{{!
    @template tool_skills/profile_skill_pills

    Pills of one skill in the Skills section of the user profile, added by plugins through the
    \tool_skills\hook\extend_profile_skill hook. A pill with a title shows it in a popover when it is
    tapped, clicked or activated with the keyboard (the same markup as Moodle's help icons, so it also
    works on touch devices); pills without a title are plain badges. Labels and titles are plain text.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none (popovers are enabled by theme_boost for data-bs-toggle (Moodle 5.x) and data-toggle (Moodle 4.5))

    Context variables required for this template:
    * pills - Array of pills, each: name, label, title, variant

    Example context (json):
    {
        "pills": [
            {
                "name": "skilladdon_decay",
                "label": "−5 decay",
                "title": "5 points removed by decay",
                "variant": "warning"
            },
            {
                "name": "example",
                "label": "Plain badge",
                "title": "",
                "variant": "secondary"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#pills}}
{{#title}}
<a class="badge rounded-pill toolskill-pill toolskill-pill-{{name}} toolskill-pill-variant-{{variant}}" role="button" tabindex="0"
    data-bs-toggle="popover" data-toggle="popover" data-bs-trigger="focus" data-trigger="focus"
    data-bs-placement="bottom" data-placement="bottom" data-bs-container="body" data-container="body"
    data-bs-content="{{title}}" data-content="{{title}}">{{label}}</a>
{{/title}}
{{^title}}
<span class="badge rounded-pill toolskill-pill toolskill-pill-{{name}} toolskill-pill-variant-{{variant}}">{{label}}</span>
{{/title}}
{{/pills}}
